{"id":"n5219e8d7a8","headline":"Japan PM Takaichi talks up weak yen even as her government works to counter currency decline","summary":"The yen has hovered at 18-month lows against the US dollar, contributing to inflation that has raised the prospect of interest rate hikes by the Bank of Japan. Takaichi has talked up the weak yen while her government works to counter the decline.","why":"The yen's level against the dollar affects Japanese import costs, inflation and the Bank of Japan's interest rate outlook, which matter for global currency and bond investors.","category":"markets","event_type":"other","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Tokyo","country":"Japan","lat":35.676,"lon":139.65,"region":"asia"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"CNA","url":"https://www.channelnewsasia.com/east-asia/japan-pm-takaichi-weak-yen-us-dollar-inflation-rate-hike-5898116"},"sources":[{"name":"CNA","url":"https://www.channelnewsasia.com/east-asia/japan-pm-takaichi-weak-yen-us-dollar-inflation-rate-hike-5898116"}],"published_at":"2026-02-01T05:07:30Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-17T20:10:53Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"028f98b8b5854c54","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-17T20:10:53Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-02-01T05:07:30Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-02-01T06:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"JA","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/banknotes-money-1963184.jpg","alt":"banknotes money (illustration)","credit":"stevepb","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/money-laundering-crime-fighting-1963184/"}}